 "summary": "One in-game day in GTA 6 lasts about two and a half real hours. When a secret only shows up late at night, go to one of your safehouses, sleep in your bed and pick Night. Hotels and random beds don't work, only your own safehouses. Perfect for the UFO, the killer clown and every night-only secret.",
